Women at the Well is a series of Live monthly gatherings for women that we filmed over an 8 year period.  In this series you’ll find a treasure chest of teachings from Stasi Eldredge and some of the Wild at Heart Women’s team.  We here at Wild at Heart are so happy to share this with you. There is always more. And isn’t that marvelous!
